---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftProjectLearningGoal
---
Construct a ProjectLearningGoal draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Interpret broad educational goals as observable project evidence and identify prerequisite skills. Separate the project’s fictional or practical theme from the competencies it must exercise, and preserve constraints on resources and learner workload.
